# what crow builds and keeps beside a program
.crow_build/
target/
# what a program run here writes: its logs, its data, its databases
*.csv
*.txt
*.json
*.db
# a program's record is kept: the fixtures its tests answer from and its
# accepted baseline (what each checked program does, derived by `crow
# check`); the book `crow book` derives on every start and the pid files
# `crow run` keeps while it serves are not
!**/.crow/fixtures/*.json
!**/.crow/baseline/
!**/.crow/baseline/**
**/.crow/book/
**/.crow/*.pid
# the OS and editors
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
__pycache__/
